# CogniDesk Web Frontend Configuration (Module 31 — Public Website)
# Target backend API URL:
# For same-domain / reverse-proxy deployments (e.g. Nginx, Docker Compose), leave blank or set to /api/v1.
# For separately hosted backends (e.g., Render, Railway, Fly.io), specify full backend URL:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL="https://api.cognidesk.yourdomain.com/api/v1"
VITE_API_BASE_URL=""
VITE_APP_VERSION="1.0.0"

# SECURITY NOTE:
# Never put AI API keys (OpenAI, Anthropic, Groq, OpenRouter) in frontend code or .env.
# All LLM provider keys are managed strictly on the backend server.
